{"aliases":[],"authors":[],"details":{"dataset_profile":{"counts":[{"basis":"computed","evidence_url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/THU-BoZhang/two-box-judge-gui/resolve/a09c08daed473ad1154414021a3d724d68deeb37/train/metadata.parquet","population":"train/metadata.parquet at revision a09c08da (106,350 labeled box 1, 9,288 labeled box 2)","qualifier":"exact","unit":"two-box samples","value":115638},{"basis":"reported","evidence_url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/THU-BoZhang/two-box-judge-gui/raw/a09c08daed473ad1154414021a3d724d68deeb37/dataset_infos.json","population":"validation split as reported; no validation files at revision a09c08da","qualifier":"exact","unit":"two-box samples","value":12849},{"basis":"reported","evidence_url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/THU-BoZhang/two-box-judge-gui/raw/a09c08daed473ad1154414021a3d724d68deeb37/dataset_infos.json","population":"train plus validation as reported by dataset_infos.json and the card","qualifier":"exact","unit":"two-box samples","value":128487}],"evidence_urls":["https://huggingface.co/datasets/THU-BoZhang/two-box-judge-gui/raw/a09c08daed473ad1154414021a3d724d68deeb37/README.md","https://huggingface.co/api/datasets/THU-BoZhang/two-box-judge-gui/revision/a09c08daed473ad1154414021a3d724d68deeb37","https://huggingface.co/datasets/THU-BoZhang/two-box-judge-gui/raw/a09c08daed473ad1154414021a3d724d68deeb37/dataset_infos.json","https://huggingface.co/datasets/THU-BoZhang/two-box-judge-gui/resolve/a09c08daed473ad1154414021a3d724d68deeb37/train/metadata.parquet"],"formats":["Parquet metadata","PNG images"],"modalities":["cropped GUI screenshots with a highlighted candidate box","natural-language click commands"],"notes":"Each sample has two image files, so image and sample counts differ. The train metadata has 27,934 distinct command strings; per its original-path columns, 98,369 train rows come from a desktop-named source folder and 17,269 from another folder. The card's per-source figures (about 70K GUIAct and 423K desktop samples) describe the pool before balancing; this release is the balanced set.","splits":["train"],"supervision":["automatically derived choice between two candidate boxes against ground truth"]},"disabled":false,"download_url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/THU-BoZhang/two-box-judge-gui/tree/a09c08daed473ad1154414021a3d724d68deeb37","gated":false,"hub_id":"THU-BoZhang/two-box-judge-gui","hub_revision":"a09c08daed473ad1154414021a3d724d68deeb37"},"environments":["web","desktop","windows","macos"],"evidence":[{"method":"editorial_primary_review","retrieved_at":"2026-10-18T15:35:11Z","role":"primary","sha256":"962d7047eaefbd0ea93a9240bd729dae0c042bba27d41a2eb0a8289fcd3bab99","supports":["name","kind","summary","environments","topics","scope","notes","relations","licenses.data","details.dataset_profile"],"url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/THU-BoZhang/two-box-judge-gui/raw/a09c08daed473ad1154414021a3d724d68deeb37/README.md"},{"method":"editorial_primary_review","retrieved_at":"2026-10-18T15:33:04Z","role":"primary","sha256":"54e36fe240316a7266800b025607da2d10a4aff3f1bcfc814d956a6f1bee4dd5","supports":["identity","release_status","details.hub_id","details.hub_revision","details.gated","details.disabled","details.download_url","details.dataset_profile"],"url":"https://huggingface.co/api/datasets/THU-BoZhang/two-box-judge-gui/revision/a09c08daed473ad1154414021a3d724d68deeb37"},{"method":"editorial_primary_review","retrieved_at":"2026-10-18T15:33:04Z","role":"primary","sha256":"96259003534aa7368a090f5c71b8da188c0ffbacf5af04ae52f3252b3a189549","supports":["details.dataset_profile"],"url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/THU-BoZhang/two-box-judge-gui/raw/a09c08daed473ad1154414021a3d724d68deeb37/dataset_infos.json"},{"method":"editorial_primary_review","retrieved_at":"2026-10-18T15:33:04Z","role":"primary","sha256":"fabf1525a1e7ad6eac27f6c3c67a24ea1e5881b39cb1e94745a1455558c5ae91","supports":["details.dataset_profile"],"url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/THU-BoZhang/two-box-judge-gui/resolve/a09c08daed473ad1154414021a3d724d68deeb37/train/metadata.parquet"},{"method":"editorial_primary_review","retrieved_at":"2026-10-18T15:33:04Z","role":"primary","sha256":"2b2685f4f68842335f3357e1f1670c00a1183ad7c629cc43fe21bca40eb1ecfb","supports":["relations","notes"],"url":"https://arxiv.org/html/2605.06664v1"},{"method":"huggingface_card","retrieved_at":"2026-10-18T15:35:11Z","role":"primary","sha256":"962d7047eaefbd0ea93a9240bd729dae0c042bba27d41a2eb0a8289fcd3bab99","supports":["licenses.data"],"url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/THU-BoZhang/two-box-judge-gui/raw/a09c08daed473ad1154414021a3d724d68deeb37/README.md"}],"id":"url:e7c3d3d49bf977b49996","identifiers":{},"kind":"dataset","last_verified_at":"2026-10-18T15:35:11Z","licenses":{"code":null,"data":{"basis":"publisher model/dataset card metadata; third-party assets retain their own terms","declared":"apache-2.0","retrieved_at":"2026-10-18T15:35:11Z","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/THU-BoZhang/two-box-judge-gui/raw/a09c08daed473ad1154414021a3d724d68deeb37/README.md"},"document":null,"weights":null},"links":[{"rel":"primary","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/THU-BoZhang/two-box-judge-gui"}],"name":"Two-Box Judge GUI Dataset","notes":"In each sample, the first crop marks the grounding model's initial box and the second the box found after masking and regrounding; both are crops around the candidate. Labels come from IoU of at least 0.5 or a center point inside the ground-truth box, with box 1 chosen when both or neither qualify, so the classes are imbalanced. The card names GUIAct web data and an unnamed Windows/macOS desktop set as sources. The 12,849-sample validation split that the card and dataset_infos.json report is not in the repository at revision a09c08da, although the bundled loader expects a validation folder. Apache-2.0 is the card's data declaration and does not settle rights in the upstream screenshots. Appendix C.3 of the BAMI paper (v1 HTML) describes training its LoRA Qwen3-VL-8B corrector on 128,487 such samples.","published_at":null,"relations":[{"evidence_url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/THU-BoZhang/two-box-judge-gui/raw/a09c08daed473ad1154414021a3d724d68deeb37/README.md","target_id":"arxiv:2605.06664","type":"documented_by"}],"review_status":"curated","scope":"core","summary":"Training data for BAMI's local correction model: pairs of cropped GUI screenshots that each highlight one candidate box, with a click command and an automatic label for the box that fits it.","task_classes":["R03.08.01.01"],"topics":["grounding","data-generation"],"updated_at":null,"url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/THU-BoZhang/two-box-judge-gui"}
